  "body_html": "<p>Bring a touch of vintage nature into your home with this beautiful custom quilt set by Jeminise. Featuring a classic cardinal design, this lightweight bedding layer is perfect for adding warmth and seasonal style to your guest room, bedroom, or even for cozying up during outdoor adventures like camping.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Personalization options include size selection, custom text inputs, and optional matching pillowcases to complete your look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted with a breathable soft polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for consecutive warmth and comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Multi-functional design works perfectly as a bed quilt, picnic mat, throw blanket, or travel companion.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on air dry settings to remain fluffy and fresh.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Xmas Red Bird-07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Animal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Bird</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cardinal Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt + Pillowcase( Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
